meta {
  name: 10. Admin - Update User Role (Protected)
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/:id/role
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  id: 2
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "role": "ADMIN"
  }
}

docs {
  **Method:** `PATCH` **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/admin/users/:id/role` **Auth:** Required (ADMIN)
  
  ## Description
  
  Updates the system role of a user between `USER` and `ADMIN`. Administrators cannot modify their own role(except himself).
  
  ## Request
  
  ### Path Parameters
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `id` | `integer` | Yes | Target user ID |
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `role` | `string` | Yes | Target system role (`USER` or `ADMIN`) |
  
  ## Response
  
  `200 OK`
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 2,
      "name": "Regular User",
      "friend_code": "DR-8M3P4X9Q5R7T",
      "email": "member@doratou.local",
      "phone": "+989123456789",
      "is_email_verified": true,
      "is_phone_verified": false,
      "avatar_attachment_id": null,
      "system_role": "ADMIN",
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "wallet": 0,
      "telegram_chat_id": null,
      "telegram_user_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  - `400 Bad Request` — Invalid role value
  - `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid token
  - `403 Forbidden` — Cannot change own role or insufficient permissions
  - `404 Not Found` — User not found
}
